{"src":"en","tgt":"ur","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":165000,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"ur","src":"en","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":7958.275226999999,"text":"The Shenzhen zone however works somewhat like one country in this respect."},{"kind":"text","t":8740.077378,"text":"تاہم، اس لحاظ سے شنزن زون کسی حد تک ایک ملک کی طرح کام کرتا ہے۔"},{"kind":"audio","t":8830.037750000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":210,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":8834.904637000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":8840.217106,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":8841.225519000001,"samples":10086,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":320},{"kind":"input","t":15115.817206,"text":"Resting on the top of one of the mountains north of Mecca, the cave is closely"},{"kind":"text","t":15894.739586,"text":"مکہ کے شمال میں پہاڑوں میں سے ایک کی چوٹی پر واقع، یہ غار بالکل"},{"kind":"audio","t":15988.214007999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":560,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":15992.904448000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":15998.120249,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":16000.9608,"samples":19560,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":710},{"kind":"input","t":17737.271360000002,"text":"isolated from the rest of the world."},{"kind":"text","t":18156.931864000002,"text":"باقی دنیا سے بالکل الگ تھلگ ہے۔"},{"kind":"audio","t":18212.077531,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":220,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":18215.847186,"samples":25467,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":940},{"kind":"input","t":26294.353587,"text":"People now write messages on computer screens never having to come close to a sharpener."},{"kind":"text","t":27424.111919,"text":"لوگ اب کمپیوٹر اسکرینز پر پیغامات لکھتے ہیں اور انہیں کبھی بھی شارپنر کے قریب آنے کی ضرورت نہیں پڑتی۔"},{"kind":"audio","t":27575.404892000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":190,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27580.657172,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27585.766085,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27590.998835000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27596.312044000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27598.31046,"samples":14489,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":490},{"kind":"input","t":37543.781617,"text":"Travelers bound for countries with heavy taxation can sometimes save a considerable amount of money, especially on products such as alcoholic beverages and tobacco."},{"kind":"text","t":39173.995521,"text":"زیادہ ٹیکس والے ممالک کا رخ کرنے والے مسافر کبھی کبھار رقم کی کافی بچت کر سکتے ہیں، خاص طور پر الکحل والے مشروبات اور تمباکو جیسی مصنوعات پر۔"},{"kind":"audio","t":39359.536098,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":190,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39364.332555999994,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39369.529377,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":39374.762427999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39380.02499799999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39385.553453,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39390.243073,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39392.727251,"samples":26414,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":990},{"kind":"input","t":45787.25683699999,"text":"Plants make their food from the sun by photosynthesis. They also provide shade."},{"kind":"text","t":46617.056668,"text":"پودے فوٹوسنتھیسز کے ذریعے سورج سے اپنی خوراک بناتے ہیں۔ وہ سایہ بھی فراہم کرتے ہیں۔"},{"kind":"audio","t":46740.430298,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":190,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46745.423612,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46750.604514,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46756.200698,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46759.206577,"samples":19114,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":690},{"kind":"input","t":58129.863153,"text":"The hospital has followed protocol for infection control, including separating the patient from others to prevent possible infection of others."},{"kind":"text","t":59662.446426999995,"text":"ہسپتال نے انفیکشن کنٹرول کے پروٹوکول پر عمل کیا ہے، جس میں دوسروں کو ممکنہ انفیکشن سے بچانے کے لیے مریض کو دوسروں سے الگ رکھنا شامل ہے۔"},{"kind":"audio","t":59839.491399,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":210,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59844.545222999994,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59849.776923,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59854.928065,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59860.004569,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59865.721061,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59869.793731,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59870.270263,"samples":8024,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":210},{"kind":"input","t":68180.058469,"text":"The work done was mostly theoretical, but the program was written to simulate observations made of the Sagittarius galaxy."},{"kind":"text","t":69385.386029,"text":"کیا گیا کام زیادہ تر نظریاتی تھا، لیکن پروگرام سیگیٹاریئس کہکشاں کے مشاہدات کی نقل کرنے کے لیے لکھا گیا تھا۔"},{"kind":"audio","t":69539.534243,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":180,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69544.510977,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1210},{"kind":"audio","t":69549.68418899999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":110,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69554.746143,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69559.88144499999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":69565.39786,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69567.832319,"samples":16551,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":530},{"kind":"input","t":78290.303268,"text":"Barcelona's official languages are Catalan and Spanish. About half prefer to speak Catalan, a vast majority understands it, and virtually everyone knows Spanish."},{"kind":"text","t":79582.31150499999,"text":"بارسلونا کی سرکاری زبانیں کیٹالان اور ہسپانوی ہیں۔ تقریباً آدھے لوگ کیٹالان بولنا پسند کرتے ہیں، ایک بڑی اکثریت اسے سمجھتی ہے، اور تقریباً ہر کوئی ہسپانوی جانتا ہے۔"},{"kind":"audio","t":79810.969165,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":170,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":79815.97884,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":79821.374197,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1170},{"kind":"audio","t":79826.622808,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":210,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":79832.101754,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":79837.14117799999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":79841.243458,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":79844.74859799999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":79847.73924699999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":79849.236301,"samples":17164,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":530},{"kind":"input","t":83918.75590399999,"text":"In some areas, boiling water for a minute is enough and other several minutes are needed."},{"kind":"text","t":84887.149215,"text":"کچھ علاقوں میں پانی کو ایک منٹ تک ابالنا کافی ہے اور دیگر میں کئی منٹ درکار ہوتے ہیں۔"},{"kind":"audio","t":84998.576889,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85003.663332,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85008.848084,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85013.75078,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85016.137509,"samples":14934,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":490},{"kind":"input","t":90160.228387,"text":"Plants look their best when in a natural environment, so resist the temptation to remove even just one stem."},{"kind":"text","t":91384.949545,"text":"پودے قدرتی ماحول میں سب سے زیادہ خوبصورت لگتے ہیں، اس لیے ایک تنے کو بھی توڑنے کے لالچ سے بچیں۔"},{"kind":"audio","t":91506.826041,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":220,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91511.889404,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91517.13204499999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91522.336956,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91526.592523,"samples":26080,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":960},{"kind":"input","t":97273.758739,"text":"During the 1920s, the prevailing attitudes of most citizens and nations was that of pacifism and isolation."},{"kind":"text","t":98371.229383,"text":"1920 کی دہائی کے دوران، زیادہ تر شہریوں اور اقوام کا عام رویہ امن پسندی اور تنہائی پسندی کا تھا۔"},{"kind":"audio","t":98511.049432,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":290,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98516.076286,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98521.301546,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98526.51379699999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98531.883185,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98534.620169,"samples":17275,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":600},{"kind":"input","t":103530.474432,"text":"Masa Serif was the apex predator of its time, so it feared nothing except other Mosul"},{"kind":"text","t":104627.92977599999,"text":"ماسا سیریف اپنے وقت کا سب سے بڑا شکاری تھا، اس لیے وہ دیگر Mosul کے علاوہ کسی چیز سے نہیں ڈرتا تھا۔"},{"kind":"audio","t":104762.78898,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":190,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104763.853791,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104765.35309599999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104767.108996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104768.660739,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104769.33026799999,"samples":3064,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":20},{"kind":"input","t":113253.726498,"text":"Since the foundation of Asuncion in 1537, Paraguay has managed to keep a lot of its indigenous character and identity."},{"kind":"text","t":114634.074005,"text":"1537 میں اسنسیون کی بنیاد رکھے جانے کے بعد سے، پیراگوئے اپنی مقامی خصوصیات اور شناخت کو کافی حد تک برقرار رکھنے میں کامیاب رہا ہے۔"},{"kind":"audio","t":114803.91639,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":190,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114808.807627,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114813.88442,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114819.16412999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114824.361421,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114829.57141199999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114833.709601,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114837.05370399999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114837.571705,"samples":10643,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":300},{"kind":"input","t":119870.934096,"text":"The disease is carried by pigs, which then migrates to humans through mosquitoes."},{"kind":"text","t":120832.188679,"text":"یہ بیماری سوروں کے ذریعے پھیلتی ہے، جو پھر مچھروں کے ذریعے انسانوں میں منتقل ہو جاتی ہے۔"},{"kind":"audio","t":120927.23428399999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":270,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":120932.74098,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1270},{"kind":"audio","t":120937.930431,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":150,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":120943.16804199999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":120945.754078,"samples":17164,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":570},{"kind":"input","t":129360.183084,"text":"Most modern research telescopes are enormous facilities in remote areas with favorable atmospheric conditions."},{"kind":"text","t":130456.610706,"text":"زیادہ تر جدید تحقیقی دوربینیں دور دراز علاقوں میں واقع بہت بڑی تنصیبات ہیں جہاں کے فضائی حالات سازگار ہوتے ہیں۔"},{"kind":"audio","t":130577.48413900001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":210,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130582.37612500001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130587.714374,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130592.96574399999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130598.253784,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130602.743927,"samples":27863,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1040},{"kind":"input","t":135223.532333,"text":"People may not anticipate that patience and understanding are also necessary for travelers"},{"kind":"text","t":136174.364635,"text":"لوگ شاید اس بات کا اندازہ نہ کریں کہ مسافروں کے لیے صبر اور سمجھ بوجھ بھی ضروری ہیں۔"},{"kind":"audio","t":136266.877333,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":136272.10137299998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":136277.328814,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":110,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":136282.508625,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":136284.199466,"samples":12984,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":450},{"kind":"input","t":140539.903576,"text":"So it is likely that the notation was added simply as a label."},{"kind":"text","t":141313.763143,"text":"چنانچہ یہ ممکن ہے کہ یہ علامت محض ایک لیبل کے طور پر شامل کی گئی ہو۔"},{"kind":"audio","t":141395.82363,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":450,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":141400.744776,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":141406.034645,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":141410.784774,"samples":28755,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1060},{"kind":"input","t":148007.07332,"text":"But there are a lot of things about birds that still look like a dinosaur."},{"kind":"text","t":149004.415286,"text":"لیکن پرندوں کے بارے میں بہت سی ایسی چیزیں ہیں جو اب بھی ڈایناسور جیسی لگتی ہیں۔"},{"kind":"audio","t":149093.587901,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":149098.596266,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":149103.953604,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":149109.09365599998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":149110.46008299998,"samples":11312,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":350},{"kind":"input","t":154975.898896,"text":"They are almost all sandy beaches with safe swimming and most have shade provided by"},{"kind":"text","t":156131.685173,"text":"یہ تقریباً سب ریتلے ساحل ہیں جہاں تیراکی محفوظ ہے اور زیادہ تر جگہوں پر سایہ موجود ہے جو کہ فراہم کیا گیا ہے"},{"kind":"audio","t":156258.984196,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":360,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156263.965731,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156269.219401,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":156274.35103299998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":140,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156279.690992,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":156284.894863,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156286.347848,"samples":10978,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":290},{"kind":"input","t":157897.779793,"text":"Pohican trees."},{"kind":"text","t":158287.837523,"text":"پوہیکان کے درختوں سے۔"},{"kind":"audio","t":158329.071558,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":158329.606459,"samples":7077,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":160},{"kind":"input","t":164332.527062,"text":"Duvall, who is married with two adult children, did not leave a big impression on Miller, to whom the story was related."},{"kind":"text","t":165635.751857,"text":"ڈیوول، جو شادی شدہ ہیں اور ان کے دو بالغ بچے ہیں، نے ملر پر کوئی خاص اثر نہیں چھوڑا، جنہیں یہ کہانی سنائی گئی تھی۔"},{"kind":"audio","t":165779.821254,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":165784.340436,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":165789.625876,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1150},{"kind":"audio","t":165794.707979,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":100,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":165800.039178,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1300},{"kind":"audio","t":165805.615763,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":165807.161686,"samples":12650,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":400},{"kind":"close","t":175905.089086,"code":1005}]}